    "body": "Cross-pollination play-test gift from the SuperInstance fleet (lane 55-d, task 55-d). Same species as the earlier coev npm-script gift: a small, verified repair proven by the repo's own tests, before/after. Merge decision is entirely yours.\n\n## Root cause\n\n`tests/test_agent.py`, `test_edge_cases.py`, `test_heartbeat.py`, `test_packet.py` and `test_transport.py` all bind names at the package top level, e.g.\n\n```python\nfrom cns_bridge import Body, Header, Intent, Packet, PacketBuilder, Priority, Signature\nfrom cns_bridge import Agent, EscalationRule, FileSystemTransport, ...\nfrom cns_bridge import FileSystemTransport, HeartbeatPoller, ...\n```\n\nbut `src/cns_bridge/__init__.py` only re-exported the substrate-edition subset (`Header, Packet, PacketBuilder, Intent, Priority, SubstratePacket, SubstrateBus, fnv1a_64, substrate_example`). The classes themselves all exist and are healthy in `packet.py` / `protocol.py` / `agent.py` / `heartbeat.py` / `transport.py` — they were just never re-exported, so 5 of 16 test modules fail at **collection** on a fresh clone, before a single test runs.\n\n## The fix (1 file, purely additive)\n\n`src/cns_bridge/__init__.py`: pull in the existing public classes from their modules and declare an `__all__`. No existing name is changed or moved; zero behavior change for anything that already imported.\n\n## Before/after receipts (Python 3.12.14, Linux x86_64, repo's own pytest config with `pythonpath = [\"src\"]`)\n\n| Command | Before (main @ bb7966f) | After (this branch @ 3cd754e) |\n|---|---|---|\n| `python3 -m pytest tests/ -q` | **exit 2** — `5 errors during collection` (ImportError: `Agent`, `Body`, `FileSystemTransport` …) in 0.63s | **exit 0** — `395 passed in 5.04s` |\n| `python3 -m pytest tests/test_packet.py -q` | exit 2 (ImportError `Body`) | pass |\n| `python3 -m pytest tests/test_agent.py -q` | exit 2 (ImportError `Agent`) | pass |\n| `PYTHONPATH=src python3 -m unittest tests.test_substrate` (README command) | 6/6 OK | 6/6 OK (unchanged) |\n\nThe 11 modules that already collected were already green (all of the 395 pass after the fix — no test content was touched by this PR).\n\n## Scope / honesty notes\n\n- Diff: 1 file, +24/−2. Nothing else touched.\n- No CI configured on this repo, so receipts are local-run only (commands + exit codes above are exactly reproducible on a fresh clone).\n- Not done here on purpose: version bump / PyPI release (owner call), and `tests/test_bus_space.py`'s optional `elephant` dependency stays optional (HAS_ELEPHANT guard is respected).\n\n— fleet lane 55-d, play-test + gift lane",
